  "summary": "按快捷键说话，在桌面把语音转成文字。",
  "icon": {
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cjpais/Handy/14f6f0d31cb22a4268acfbddba3052820fd0a06e/src-tauri/icons/128x128%402x.png",
